This repository contains documentation, scripts, configuration and measurement data for running
RadixArk/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 with vLLM on a single NVIDIA GB10. It builds on:

- vLLM (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm - base image vllm/vllm-openai:v0.29.0
- blazux/qwen3.8-Flash-DGX (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 blazux), https://github.com/blazux/qwen3.8-Flash-DGX
  commit d542745: Dockerfile.v0.29, serve.sh, patches, tools/build_draft_vocab.py.
  build/baue_b_inner.sh is a transcript of its Dockerfile.v0.29; config/serve.sh.goldvllm.patch modifies its scripts/serve.sh.
- jschmied/qwen38-flash-next-gb10 (deterministic top-k kernel, fetched by Dockerfile.v0.29 at e0ef69d; switched off in GoldVllm)
- SGLang (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang - only used for the comparison in docs/SGLANG.md
- The model RadixArk/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 is NOT included and is subject to its own license (see its model card).

draftvocab/draft_vocab_de_65536.npy is a list of token ids derived by the authors from German domain texts.
NVIDIA documentation texts used as benchmark filler are not included.
